Description:
打开图并开始实时调试给定实体的 AG2 图
参数：实体名称
参数：{entity_name} / {class_name} / {entity_index} / {无参数 = 选择玩家正在查看的内容}

Description_EN:
Opens the graph and starts live debugging the AG2 graph for a given entity
Arguments: entityName
Arguments:   	{entity_name} / {class_name} / {entity_index} / {no argument = pick what player is looking at}

Description:
开始实时调试并记录给定实体的 AG2 图
参数：实体名称
参数：{entity_name} / {class_name} / {entity_index} / {无参数 = 选择玩家正在查看的内容}

Description_EN:
Starts live debugging & recording the AG2 graph for a given entity
Arguments: entityName
Arguments:   	{entity_name} / {class_name} / {entity_index} / {no argument = pick what player is looking at}
